# GrantTap exact dual-channel correlation

- Send the same complete interactive prompt to Cursor chat and GrantTap under
  one exact correlation identity.
- The first answer with that exact correlation wins. Never resolve a request
  with a response from another chat, agent task, prompt, or correlation.
